{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108685","id":2672019984,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6fQ8oQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108685","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108685.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108685.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108685","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108685/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108685/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108685/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d865c401913b753d0aa5dcb11821693d83424294","number":108685,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"pcre2: Backport a fix causing duplicate symbol definitions","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"modules/regex/SCsub compiles the pcre2 sources twice: once for 16-bit and once for 32-bit code unit width.  Most of the pcre2 code uses a `PCRE2_SUFFIX()` macro to append the code unit width suffix to the function name to avoid conflicting function names when compiling this way.  However, this was missed for the internal `chd_smul` function, resulting in both the 16-bit and 32-bit versions defining a function with the same name. The duplicate symbol definition was only triggering a warning at link time and was not causing the build to fail, but this means that either the 16-bit or 32-bit code will end up calling a function that operates on the incorrect data type.\r\n\r\nThis backports the fix already applied upstream.  (Buried in one line of https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/commit/9a868b060) pcre2 does not yet have any new releases that include this fix.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-16T21:33:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T22:42:03Z","closed_at":"2026-01-